The MIT License of the upstream `Hungbocluaqua/hermex-android-port` is
preserved in LICENSE and governs this derivative work.

Modifications in this fork include:
- Full visual rebrand to OLYMPUS brand (logo, colors, typography)
- 18 locales strings.xml updated from "Hermex" to "OLYMPUS"
- Material3 theme rewritten with navy (#0A1628) + orange (#F59E0B)
- Adaptive-icon XMLs added for default icon (API 26+ and API 33+)
- Network Security Config added: strict TLS, cleartext only on RFC 1918
- Release signing with Kyrius keystore (SHA256 fingerprint in README)
- 14 security tests added (tests_cli/test_security.py in companion repo)
- CI pipeline for signed release builds via GitHub Actions

Package identifier `com.uzairansar.hermex` is preserved to maintain
install compatibility with the upstream repo during the fork transition.

All modifications are documented in CHANGELOG.md and visible in the
commit history on GitHub.
